<h2>What's New in 1.9.24</h2>  <ul><li><strong>No unexpected Keychain prompts:</strong> AIQuota now checks for reusable Claude Code credentials silently. If macOS cannot grant access without interrupting you, the app falls back to its normal Claude sign-in path.</li> <li><strong>More reliable updates:</strong> every Sparkle update now uses an immutable, build-specific download. Previously cached update information can no longer resolve to a differently signed archive.</li></ul> <img src="https://github.com/niederme/ai-quota/releases/download/v1.9.24/AIQuota-1.9.24.png" alt="AIQuota 1.9.24" width="600">
